  "coreInvariants": [
    "Never record before explicit user start and recording prerequisites",
    "Show Capturing only after actual audio frames",
    "Never automatically speak private advice on phone loudspeaker after earbud disconnect",
    "Never assign real speaker identities solely from diarization",
    "Every sourced meeting claim must include permission-scoped playable evidence",
    "Do not conceal network or capture gaps",
    "Stop capture on device immediately even if backend is unavailable",
    "Speaker correction invalidates affected derived memories",
    "Do not reveal cross-tenant information in any result or citation",
    "Honor AI-assistance rules in interviews and similar assessments"
  ],
